    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exemplārĭum</span></b> ,
		ii, n.
		exemplar, post-class for exemplar (cf. Lachm. ad <i><span class="en">Lucr. p.
		82</span></i>). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A copy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">binae tabulae testamenti eodem tempore
					exemplarii causa scriptae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					31, 47</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hier. adv. Helv. 8</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A model</i>, <i>pattern</i>, <i>original</i>, <i><span class="en">Arn. 6,
			198</span></i>; Schol. Lucan. 9, 563.</div>
